 "summary": "S9013 is one NPN bipolar transistor in a three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount body, good for 25 V collector to emitter, 500 mA of collector current and 300 mW of dissipation at 25 °C ambient. S9012 is its PNP partner. Units are graded by hFE(1), measured at VCE = 1 V and IC = 50 mA, into rank L (120 to 200), H (200 to 350) and J (300 to 400); the 200-350 range is rank H. The body is marked J3.",
